  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the area bounded by the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis and the ordinates <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "62",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bbf502b1-ee0b-4f91-8a19-25146a46eb10-e5603b07-a5c8-4549-bba8-c03ddc09bf6f-9889529.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Now area of the above&nbsp;region is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>31</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>62</mn></math></p>",
